{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在短停留段落的感受描述较长，尤其连续出现多个比喻时，观众可能来不及读完；X的短词更容易快速扫视。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然阅读负担更大，但【】突出心理转折，使观众能迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，同时保留人物犹豫、想念、抗拒和逐渐自我接纳的因果关系。更重要的是，感受描述不仅给情绪贴标签，还把音色、节奏、身体反应和心理变化联系起来，且部分内容随音乐时点出现，使音乐与人物经历形成连续对应。X更便于快速扫词，但大量感受并列呈现，容易让观众得到许多局部情绪，却不容易体会这些情绪如何发生、转变，以及为什么最终走向这样的选择。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ea4d4547-c9a7-4768-9b7d-f92ff0c1f57a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T024203123981Z", "elapsed_seconds": 28.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T02:42:31.863484+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "101c0f4f2bdb7319b7c255f0416b71ab02c3767bdb0250e6fb8efa18b5ab4a7b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool